B.Py=new A.bb("strategy.centre","Control the centre","Pieces in the middle reach both wings; pieces on the edge reach little. A knight on e5 has eight moves, a knight on a1 has two. That is why the opening is a fight for d4, e4, d5 and e5.",null,B.Rm,null,!1,"","d4 e4 d5 e5",!1,B.C)
