B.P7=new A.bb("strategy.kingsafety","King safety","The king is safest behind unmoved pawns in a corner, with a knight on f3 or f6 in front of it. Castle before the centre opens, and think twice before pushing the pawns in front of the castled king: every push leaves a hole that never closes.",null,B.T_,null,!1,"","",!1,B.C)
