B.Pu=new A.bb("strategy.trade","When to trade","Ahead in material: trade pieces, not pawns. A rook up is decisive with nothing else on the board. Behind: trade pawns, not pieces, and keep the queens. Also trade when you are short of space, and to get rid of your opponent's best piece.","3q1rk1/5pp1/7p/8/8/8/5PPP/R2Q1RK1 w - - 0 1",B.Sd,null,!1,"","",!1,B.C)
