B.OX=new A.bb("end.kq","King and queen against king","Play this one out against the engine. Method: put the queen a knight's move away from the enemy king, and keep doing that as it retreats; this shrinks its box without giving check. Once it is on the edge, stop, bring your own king up, and mate. Leave the king a square to move to until then, or it is stalemate.","8/8/8/4k3/8/8/8/3QK3 w - - 0 1",B.eQ,B.jg,!1,"","",!1,B.C)
B.P3=new A.bb("end.kr","King and rook against king","Slower than with a queen, and your king has to do half the work. Use the rook as a wall to cut the king off, bring your king up so the two kings face each other, and check with the rook when they do: the king must step back a rank. If your king cannot improve, make a waiting move with the rook along its wall.","8/8/8/4k3/8/8/8/R3K3 w - - 0 1",B.eQ,B.jg,!1,"","",!1,B.C)
